</tr>
<tr>
<td class="white"><span class="color3">作者：Einh</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="red"><span class="color2">ジャンル：ギャンブル金策SLG</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="white"><span class="color3">動画・配信：可</span></td>
